[h1]Reclaim the Motherland / 重整河山[/h1]

[b]The Mandate may be lost. The dynasty need not vanish with it.[/b]
[b]天命可以失去，王朝不必随之湮灭。[/b]

Version 0.4.0 · CK3 1.19.0.6 · All Under Heaven required

[h1]A New Default Rule / 新增默认规则[/h1]

The game rule “Fate of the Chinese Hegemon” offers two paths. “Reclaim the Motherland” is enabled by default; “Vanilla Shattering” preserves the original behavior.
游戏规则【中华霸权统治者的命运】提供两条路线，默认启用【重整河山】；选择【群雄割据（原版）】即可恢复原版行为。

A second rule, “The Choice of the Loyalists,” defaults to “Divided Hearts.” Choose “Unwavering Loyalty” to preserve the 0.1 behavior where every Pro-Hegemon vassal remains.
第二项规则【尊王诸侯的抉择】默认选择【人心离散】；若希望沿用 0.1 版“尊王派全员留下”的行为，可改选【誓死尊王】。

[h1]When All Under Heaven Fractures / 群雄割据之时[/h1]

[list]
[*]The old ruler loses the Chinese Hegemony, but keeps every personally held domain and unrelated title. / 旧天子失去中华霸权，但进入群雄割据前亲自持有的领地与其他个人头衔仍归本人。
[*]A new empty-de-jure Hegemony is created as “Later + old dynasty name”: for example, Later Song / 后宋. / 创建空法理的“后＋原朝号”霸权，例如【后宋】。
[*]Pro-Hegemon lords now decide once at the moment of fracture. Open war, deep enmity, disloyalty, very low opinion, and independence or claimant factions can force rebellion; close bonds can guarantee loyalty; everyone else weighs opinion, character, rank, military strength, imperial legitimacy, and dread. / 尊王诸侯会在裂解一刻作出一次抉择：战事、深仇、不忠、极低好感以及独立或宣称者派系可令其必叛；深厚羁绊可令其必留；其余人再权衡好感、性情、地位、军力、天子合法性与威慑。
[*]A lord who finally remains keeps the same primary title, displayed or custom realm name, direct liege, and complete subordinate realm tree. “Qingxu Circuit” will not be arbitrarily renamed during the shattering. / 最终留下的忠臣保留原主头衔、显示或自定义国号、直属关系与完整下级封臣树；【青徐路】不会再因群雄割据被随意换号。
[*]Defectors and every other direct vassal break away and continue through vanilla Chaos reorganization. / 反叛的尊王诸侯与其他直属封臣脱离，并继续按原版群雄割据逻辑重组。
[/list]

[h1]The Later Dynasty and Its Court / 后朝与旧朝廷[/h1]

[list]
[*]The Later-Dynasty Hegemony now has an explicit primary heir and survives the engine's death settlement for an empty-de-jure dynamic Hegemony. Existing Later titles from older saves are migrated idempotently when loaded. / 后朝霸权现具有明确的主继承人，并能跨过空法理动态霸权的死亡结算；旧版存档中的既有后朝会在加载时幂等补齐继承合同。
[*]When the former emperor dies, the same Later title and the loyalist realm beneath it pass to the primary heir. Other personal titles continue to follow the character's normal succession rules. / 旧君驾崩后，同一后朝头衔及其下的忠臣封臣树由主继承人接续；其他个人头衔仍按角色原有继承规则处理。
[*]The nine central ministries continue under the most recent Later Dynasty. Eligible incumbents who remain in the realm keep their exact offices; ministers who explicitly defect lose office, while genuine vacancies return to the normal appointment flow instead of triggering a wholesale reshuffle during the shattering. / 最近失去天命的后朝继续保有三省六部九席；仍在旧朝且合资格的原班大臣原位留任，明确叛离者失去官职，真实空缺交回原版任免流程，不在裂解事务中批量洗牌。
[*]This continuity does not preserve the formal Grand Secretariat power-sharing system, the Mandate, or privileges reserved for the holder of the Chinese Hegemony. / 这项延续不保留正式中书门下权力分享制度、天命或中华霸权持有者专属特权。
[/list]

[h1]No Instant Diplomatic Reunification / 割据不再顷刻归附[/h1]

A Later Dynasty is no longer treated as the reigning Chinese Hegemony by Offer Vassalization. It loses the special celestial rank-gap, Hegemony, and high-tier-ruler exemptions that caused whole groups of warlords to accept immediately.
后朝在【提议附庸】中不再被误当成现任中华霸权，不再获得天朝等级差、霸权身份及高阶诸侯拒绝豁免等现任霸权待遇。

Direct vassals actually released by this shattering carry a title-bound “Recently Independent” memory of that exact Later Dynasty for five years. Its holder receives a visible -50 acceptance reason against vassalization by that dynasty; changing rulers cannot bypass it, and it expires naturally. This is a soft political resistance, not a hard ban: patient diplomacy remains viable.
本轮群雄割据中由该后朝实际释放的直属诸侯，其主头衔会保留五年【新近自立】记忆。期间面对该后朝的附庸提议会出现一项公开的 -50 接受度；双方换君不能绕过，期满自然消失。这是短期政治抗拒，并非硬性禁止，长期经营仍可走外交统一路线。

[h1]Proclaim the Restoration / 宣称复辟[/h1]

A Later-Dynasty holder cannot use the original “Claim the Mandate” decision. During Chaos, once the restorer controls a majority of the Chinese Hegemony's de-jure counties—currently 51%, including qualifying tributary land—“Proclaim the Restoration” becomes available.
后朝持有者不能执行原版【宣称天命】。在群雄割据期间，重新控制中华霸权法理领地的过半伯爵领——当前门槛为 51%，符合条件的朝贡国领地同样计入——即可执行【宣称复辟】。

Restoration completes the same founding of a new dynasty, submission of the warlords, and closure of the Dynastic Cycle as Claim the Mandate; the Later-Dynasty name then passes into history.
宣称复辟后，新朝建立、群雄归附与王朝循环收束均与【宣称天命】一致；后朝之号随即归入历史。

[h1]0.4.0 更新记录[/h1]

[list]
[*]修复空法理后朝霸权在死亡结算中无法可靠传给主继承人的问题，并为旧版后朝存档增加幂等迁移。
[*]旧君驾崩后，后朝头衔与留朝忠臣封臣树继续由主继承人统领。
[*]后朝延续三省六部九席：留朝合资格的原班大臣不动，随割据者离朝的大臣离任，只补空缺。
[*]修正后朝被和平附庸公式误当成现任中华霸权的问题。
[*]本轮实际脱离的直属诸侯获得五年、绑定双方头衔且可见的【新近自立】-50 接受度。
[*]二期【人心离散】、忠臣国号与封臣树保护、51% 原版门槛及【宣称复辟】保持不变。
[/list]

