[h1]Verification / 验收[/h1]

The release uses a reproducible 35-file staging tree. Its MCP-first CK3 1.19.0.6 matrix exercises Chaos, loyalist continuity, Later-title inheritance through an actual ruler death, the same nine ministry incumbents before and after succession, two real Offer Vassalization refusals, timed expiry of the title-bound resistance, the 51% threshold, and restoration.
正式版本使用可复现的 35 文件 staging。MCP-first CK3 1.19.0.6 矩阵实际执行群雄割据、忠臣封臣树延续、旧君死亡后的同一后朝继承、继承前后九席原班大臣一致、两名真实割据诸侯拒绝即时附庸、头衔绑定抗拒的定时到期、51% 门槛及宣称复辟。

[h1]Localization / 本地化[/h1]

English / 简体中文 / Français / Deutsch / 日本語 / 한국어 / Polski / Русский / Español

The seven additional release languages were generated as MiniMax-M3 candidates and reviewed and corrected for meaning, terminology and CK3 formatting. This is model-led review, not native-speaker certification.
七种新增发布语言先由 MiniMax-M3 产出候选，再逐条审核并修正语义、术语与 CK3 格式；这是模型代行的发布审核，不冒充母语译者认证。

[h1]Compatibility / 兼容性[/h1]

Requires CK3 1.19.0.6 and All Under Heaven. Start a new single-player game. Existing Later titles gain the succession migration, but an old save already inside Chaos cannot reconstruct which lords were released by this mod, so the five-year memory applies only to new shatterings after the update. In multiplayer, a human Pro-Hegemon vassal uses the same frozen factors and a public deterministic 50-point boundary because the atomic shattering effect cannot pause for several clients. This mod overrides four vanilla keys: [code]tgp_chaos_shattering_effect[/code], [code]situation_dynastic_cycle_claim_mandate_decision[/code], [code]tgp_has_access_to_ministry_trigger[/code], and [code]offer_vassalization_interaction[/code]. Mods replacing one of these keys may conflict by load order.
需要 CK3 1.19.0.6 与《溥天之下 / All Under Heaven》，推荐新开单人存档。旧版既有后朝会获得继承迁移；但已经处于群雄割据的旧存档无法重建当时由本 mod 释放的精确名单，因此五年记忆只适用于更新后新发生的群雄割据。多人游戏中，由于裂解过程无法暂停并逐个等待多名客户端，人类尊王封臣使用同一套冻结因素及公开的 50 分确定性分界。本 mod 覆写四个原版 key：[code]tgp_chaos_shattering_effect[/code]、[code]situation_dynastic_cycle_claim_mandate_decision[/code]、[code]tgp_has_access_to_ministry_trigger[/code] 与 [code]offer_vassalization_interaction[/code]；其他 mod 若覆写其中之一，可能发生加载顺序冲突。

